1
00:00:00,260 --> 00:00:03,115
What if Earth spun faster,
and couldn't stop?

2
00:00:04,623 --> 00:00:07,708
Only about 17×
faster, a day of an hour

3
00:00:07,708 --> 00:00:10,203
and 24 minutes, and you
leave the ground behind.

4
00:00:11,558 --> 00:00:12,578
That is the whole distance

5
00:00:12,578 --> 00:00:14,158
between standing
and flying.

6
00:00:14,725 --> 00:00:17,345
Only the spin changes,
and it only gets faster.

7
00:00:20,415 --> 00:00:23,475
What you feel is a tiny
push outward: the spin

8
00:00:23,475 --> 00:00:25,615
makes you about a third
of a percent lighter.

9
00:00:26,248 --> 00:00:28,033
Now the spin speeds up.

10
00:00:28,727 --> 00:00:29,482
Hang on.

11
00:00:29,482 --> 00:00:31,402
If you're enjoying this,
tap like and follow.

12
00:00:31,402 --> 00:00:33,247
Okay, back to the math.

13
00:00:34,793 --> 00:00:38,163
And then the spin has only
just begun to speed up.

14
00:00:39,175 --> 00:00:40,205
Part 1 of 8.
